 "submission": {
  "summary": "F-14 declined after 2010-01-24 and again after 2012-02-05. Using the post-2010-01-24 exponential fit the 12 month forecast from 2013-01-02 is about 276078 Sm3 P50, with P90 259265 Sm3 and P10 292363 Sm3, declining from 995.02 to 725.92 Sm3/d. Confidence is moderate as the fit has r2 0.7747 but the most recent level is lower.",
