    "claim": "F-14 has two oil-rate regime changes: around 2010-01-24 weekly mean 3593 to 2082 and around 2012-02-05 weekly mean 2082 to 1142. Recent monthly oil rate per producing day was 1017 in December 2012 and 1030 in January 2013 at water cut 0.7564.",
